# 🎓 MERN LMS with Streaming Features

A full-featured Learning Management System (LMS) built using the MERN stack (MongoDB, Express, React, Node.js) with integrated **video streaming capabilities**.

## 🚀 Features

- 👨‍🏫 Instructor & Student Roles
- 🧾 Course Creation & Management
- 🎥 Video Upload & Streaming (secure playback)
- 🧠 Quizzes & Assignments
- 📊 Progress Tracking
- 💬 Comments & Discussions
- 🔐 Authentication & Authorization (JWT)
- 🎨 Modern UI with React + Tailwind CSS

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Tech | Usage |
|------|-------|
| MongoDB | Database for storing users, courses, progress, etc. |
| Express.js | Backend framework for APIs |
| React.js | Frontend UI |
| Node.js | Runtime for backend server |
| Mongoose | MongoDB ODM |
| Multer / Cloudinary | File uploads & video storage |
| HLS / Video.js | Video streaming (adaptive) |
| Tailwind CSS | Styling |
| JWT | Authentication |

